("ul",[
"**Double possessive** (*of* + possessive): *a friend of mine, this book of yours, a poem of Tagore's* (not <s>a my friend</s>, <s>this your book</s>).",
"**Own** after a possessive: *my own house*, not <s>an own house</s>; *of one's own*.",
"**Possessive before a gerund:** *I dislike **his** coming late. / She insisted on **my** staying.* (Object form is acceptable informally; use possessive in board answers.)",
"**Parts of the body / clothes:** use *his / her* with a possessive, but use *the* after a preposition when the person is the object: *He hit **me on the** head.* / *She caught him **by the** arm.* (but *He hurt **his** leg.*)",
"**Its / it's, whose / who's, their / there / they're** — apostrophe errors are routinely planted in editing items.",
"**Demonstrative + of**: *this is one of those problems that…* (plural noun); *those who work hard…* (those = people).",
"**This kind / sort / type of** takes a singular noun; *these kinds of* takes a plural: *This kind of mango is sweet. / These kinds of mangoes are sweet.*",
"**What vs which:** *what* = open choice (*What colour do you like?*), *which* = limited choice (*Which of these two colours do you like?*). *Whichever / whatever* = any one at all."]),
